His message:

Do you have library Hmisc attached ahead of splus in the search list?

The Hmisc library in S-PLUS 7.0 has a version of help that is not
compatible with S-PLUS 7.0. You can remove or rename the help function
in library Hmisc and things should work OK:

             library(Hmisc, first=T)
             setDBStatus("Hmisc", T)
             assign("help.orig", get("help", where="Hmisc"), where="Hmisc")
             remove("help", where="Hmisc")

                                                                                
                                                              
